      "id": "external-sarajevo-times-the-former-chief-of-the-general-staff-of-the-yugoslav-army-momcilo-perisic-released-https-sarajevotimes-c",
      "title": "The former Chief of the General Staff of the Yugoslav Army, Momcilo Perisic, released",
      "summary": "The former Chief of the General Staff of the Yugoslav Army, Momčilo Perišić, was released after serving more than two-thirds of the four-year prison sentence he was sentenced to for espionage, lawyer Novak Lukić confirmed for RTS. In 2022, the Appellate Court in Belgrade sentenced Perišić to four years in prison for divulging state secrets, [&#8230;] The post The former Chief of the General Staff of the Yugoslav Army, Momcilo Perisic, released appeared first on Sarajevo Times .",
